# Non-public design docs and scratch. This repo is public, and both spellings
# are ignored on purpose: notes have been written to docs/ while only doc/wip/
# was ignored, which left `git add -A` one typo away from publishing them.
# Neither directory holds anything tracked, so guessing the name wrong now fails
# safe. To publish a file from here later, unignore the directory and then the
# file — an ignored directory is never descended into, so an exception inside it
# would not be seen:
#   /docs/*
#   !/docs/the-one-to-track.md
/doc/
/docs/
/.prompt/
/.idea/

# Compiled crofty binary
/crofty

# Dogfood site instance (user content + deploy config; lives here only as a
# working copy for now, not part of the public product)
/site/

# Build output and per-project tool state (in case a project lives in-repo)
/dist/
/.crofty/

# wharfy's generated release config and build artifacts (regenerated each run)
/.wharfy/

# Wrangler local cache (created when deploy shells out)
/.wrangler/

# examples/ holds focused single-purpose crofty sites (blog, portfolio, shop, …)
# that showcase the breadth of sites crofty builds. Keep the source, ignore build
# output and per-deploy tool state (.crofty holds the deploy-specific account id).
/examples/*/dist/
/examples/*/public/
/examples/*/.crofty/
/examples/*/.wrangler/
/examples/*/.hugo_build.lock
.amenbo
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
